.TH CRUNCH_TIMER_GETTIME 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
crunch_timer_gettime \- Linux x86-64 syscall 224
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/syscall_220_259.h>
.B int crunch_timer_gettime(int timer, struct itimerspec* value);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads a kernel POSIX timer.
This is a direct Linux x86-64 syscall wrapper; availability and permissions depend on the kernel and security policy.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set on failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR timer_gettime (2)
